        "correct": 2,
        "working": "According to the ACCA F1 syllabus and Exam Kit (Question 16.1), the correct answer is 'Screening application forms'. Screening means sorting through application forms received, in order to separate out candidates which are clearly ineligible for the vacancy, immediately worth short-listing and so on. It is selection because it is part of the process of measuring candidates against requirements, and selecting those who are most suitable. Recruitment is the process of defining requirements and rea",
