        "working": "According to ACCA F1 Exam Kit (Question 16.2), the correct option is 'Job description'. This is job description rather than job analysis, because a job description is the statement produced from a process of job analysis. This is job description rather than personnel specification, because it addresses the requirements of the job, rather than the qualities of the ideal job holder or person. Job advertisement is just a distractor.",
        "romanUrdu": "ACCA F1 Exam Kit ke mutabiq sahi jawab 'Job description' hai.",
        "examTip": "CBE exam mein questions aur options ko ehtiyat se parhein."
