        "correct": 2,
        "working": "According to the ACCA F1 syllabus and Exam Kit (Question 18.4), the correct answer is 'Attitudes'. This is the definition of attitudes. Personality traits are relatively stable, enduring qualities of an individual's personality (eg 'impulsiveness'). Perceptions are how people 'see' things, according to how the brain selects and organises information. Emotional intelligence is a concept popularised by Daniel Goleman to describe awareness of, and ability to manage, one's own emotions and those of ",
