        "correct": [
          0,
          2
        ],
        "working": "Independent reconciliations and dual authorisation are essential preventive and detective controls. Combining handling and recording creates an unacceptable fraud risk.",
        "romanUrdu": "Fraud aur error rokne ke liye do ahem tareeqay hain: azaadana reconciliation aur baray transactions par do afrad ki manzoori.",
        "examTip": "Controls questions mein segregation of duties aur reconciliation hamesha gold standard hote hain."
