        "correct": 0,
        "working": "Gross purchases = $36,000 with 20% tax: Net purchases = $36,000 / 1.20 = $30,000. Input sales tax = $6,000 (recoverable asset). Entry: Debit Purchases $30,000, Debit Sales Tax $6,000, Credit Trade Payables Control $36,000.",
        "romanUrdu": "Net khareedari $30,000 Debit, Input Tax $6,000 Debit, aur Trade Payables $36,000 Credit hon ge.",
