        "id": "acffa2-ch8-q01",
        "qText": "A delivery vehicle was purchased on 1 January 20X1 for $20,000 with an estimated useful life of 5 years and an estimated residual value of $2,000. The company uses the straight-line method of depreciation. What is the annual depreciation charge and the carrying amount at 31 December 20X2?",
