        "id": "acffa2-ch17-q08",
        "qText": "A company's draft profit for the year ended 31 December 20X4 was $83,600. It was later discovered that $18,000 paid for purchase of manufacturing plant had been debited to the Plant Repairs account, and that closing inventory was overstated by $5,000. Depreciation is charged on plant at 20% per annum straight line. What is the corrected profit for the year?",
