        "qText": "True or False: Proper implementation of internal controls within Costs Of Goods Sold And Treatment Of Inventories guarantees the complete elimination of operational and fraud risk.",
        "type": "true_false",
        "options": [
          "True",
          "False"
        ],
        "correct": 1,
        "working": "FALSE: Internal controls provide reasonable assurance, not absolute assurance, due to inherent limitations such as collusion, human error, and management override.",
