        "correct": 3,
        "working": "According to ACCA MA1 Exam Kit (Question 10.12), the correct option is D ('$87,500'). If materials costs are 18% of the total, then the total costs must be 100/18 × 63,000 = 350,000. Direct labour costs must therefore be 25% × 350,000 = $87,500.",
        "romanUrdu": "ACCA MA1 Exam Kit ke mutabiq sahi jawab Option D ('$87,500') hai.",
        "examTip": "CBE exam mein questions aur data tables ko ehtiyat se parhein."
