        "id": "acfma2-ch8-q01",
        "qText": "A business experiences a transaction related to Absorption Costing with a monetary value of $8,050. How should this be recorded in the accounting records?",
        "type": "single",
        "options": [
          "Credit Asset/Expense $8,050, Debit Equity $8,050",
          "Debit Asset/Expense $8,050, Credit Payable/Cash $8,050",
          "Debit Equity $8,050, Credit Revenue $8,050",
          "No entry is made until the end of the financial year"
        ],
        "correct": 1,
        "working": "Under the dual aspect principle, transactions in Absorption Costing require matching debit and credit entries of $8,050.",
        "romanUrdu": "Double entry ka rule yaad rakhein: debit aur credit barabar hotay hain. Yahan $8,050 ki sahi posting debit aur credit side par hogi.",
        "examTip": "Calculation aur entry questions mein debit/credit direction lazmi verify karein."
