        "options": [
          "True",
          "False"
        ],
        "correct": 1,
        "working": "FALSE: Adverse variances can result from external factors (such as price inflation or supply shortages) or unrealistic planning budgets, not solely poor operational performance.",
        "romanUrdu": "GHALAT (False): Har adverse variance staff ki ghalti nahi hoti; market mein qeematein barhna ya budget ka ghalat banna bhi wajah ho sakti hai.",
        "examTip": "Variance analysis mein operational performance aur planning errors ko alag alag evaluate kiya jata hai."
