        "id": "acfma2-ch22-q01",
        "qText": "A business experiences a transaction related to Working Capital Management with a monetary value of $22,050. How should this be recorded in the accounting records?",
        "type": "single",
        "options": [
          "Credit Asset/Expense $22,050, Debit Equity $22,050",
          "Debit Asset/Expense $22,050, Credit Payable/Cash $22,050",
          "Debit Equity $22,050, Credit Revenue $22,050",
          "No entry is made until the end of the financial year"
        ],
        "correct": 1,
        "working": "Under the dual aspect principle, transactions in Working Capital Management require matching debit and credit entries of $22,050.",
        "romanUrdu": "Double entry ka rule yaad rakhein: debit aur credit barabar hotay hain. Yahan $22,050 ki sahi posting debit aur credit side par hogi.",
        "examTip": "Calculation aur entry questions mein debit/credit direction lazmi verify karein."
